{"id":"wb-8-308","name":"稠墅牌坊群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"稠墅牌坊群","text":"稠墅牌坊群位于中国安徽省黄山市歙县郑村镇稠墅村。稠墅汪姓世代经商，在稠墅村口建有四座牌坊。\n\n父子大夫坊：明崇祯元年（1628年）建；\n吴氏节孝坊：清乾隆十五年（1750）建；\n褒荣三世坊：清乾隆二十七年建；\n方氏节孝坊：清乾隆三十九年建；\n2019年10月，稠墅牌坊群公布为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%A8%A0%E5%A2%85%E7%89%8C%E5%9D%8A%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":86555672,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86555672","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/529814e3549feb832c789f6e.jpg","title":"Choushu_Archway_Group,_2021-09-26_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Choushu_Archway_Group,_2021-09-26_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/Choushu_Archway_Group%2C_2021-09-26_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​黄山稠墅牌坊群","width":320,"height":214}}